			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-678746">
									

<p>I imagined the original intent was to have the membrane detach cleanly when the person leaves water, so they could simply go back to breathing air. Unfortunately, the original creators couldn't figure out how to stop the stuff from being produced, and couldn't stop it from hardening on air contact.</p>
<p>I had a head cold for like six weeks over the winter holidays, and the idea cross-pollinated with that stuff from the TV show Fringe that I don't like remembering and with a scene from a Star Wars novel. It worked out rather well ^_^</p>

