			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2083841">
									

<p>I feel like there is something a little backwards here, shouldn't the main SCP be the virus, not the snot it makes you produce? The mucus is caused by the virus so I feel it should be changed to SCP-340-2, and the virus itself changed to SCP-340.</p>
